            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>After 25 years, the Healthcare Effectiveness Data and Information Set (HEDIS) is still criticized for focusing on process and taking up doctors' time. But it has been incorporated into physicians' workflow and may yet be instrumental in bringing about value-based care.</AbstractText>
